    <string name="about_summary">Version, developer and open-source credits</string>
    <string name="about_developer">Jotapeveloper 2026</string>
    <string name="about_version_fmt">v%1$s</string>
    <string name="about_libraries_title">Open-source libraries</string>
    <string name="about_libraries_body"><![CDATA[<b>Oboe</b> · Google · Apache 2.0
Low-latency audio stream on Android.

<b>SoundTouch</b> · Olli Parviainen · LGPL 2.1
Real-time pitch shift and tempo change.

<b>dr_flac</b> · David Reid (mackron) · MIT / Public Domain
Single-header FLAC decoder.

<b>chords-db</b> · David Rubert · MIT
Guitar and ukulele chord shapes.

<b>KEMAR HRTF dataset</b> · MIT Media Lab
Head-related impulse responses for the Audio 3D mode. Free for research and personal use.

<b>Material Components</b> · Google · Apache 2.0
UI components, buttons, dialogs.

<b>AndroidX / Room</b> · Google · Apache 2.0
Persistence, biometrics, transitions, preferences.

<b>OkHttp / Retrofit</b> · Square · Apache 2.0
HTTP client and server API bindings.]]></string>
